== unknown fields: forward compatibility, and ABI v1 open decision 11 ==
java.version=17.0.20
protobuf-java=protobuf-java-3.25.5.jar

A corpus generated from the schema that reads it never executes the
unknown-field skip (README 10.1), so these vectors are spliced here.

